  "changes": [
    "Validate saved mod compatibility before disabling the current world or notifying connected peers of loading.",
    "Preserve current simulation, commands, saving, pause, speed and command generation when a save is refused.",
    "During restoration of different saved mod values by a host alone, refuse transitional joins with a retry notice; admit matching guests after completion."
  ],
