    "input": "Synthetic Godot keyboard, mouse and gamepad events through normal handlers; no manual controller acceptance claim",
    "network": "Actual ENet host/guest peers in independent SceneMultiplayer branches in one process for load refusal and transitional joins; separate authority process/service in worker checks",
    "isolation": "Disposable desktop XDG state and device mod profiles; settings, saves and profile directories restored. Public Android application untouched.",
